WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.500
The panel opens on Clean My OS. A DEMO label says the files in this preview are made up.

00:04.500 --> 00:08.500
Scan this PC is pressed. The scan walks through its places one by one.

00:08.500 --> 00:13.500
2.3 GB is found in groups. The first group opens to show folders, their paths, sizes and ages.

00:13.500 --> 00:17.500
Browser caches is unticked, and the total drops to 825 MB.

00:17.500 --> 00:22.000
Move to Recycle Bin asks for confirmation and lists each group that will move.

00:22.000 --> 00:26.000
After confirming, the result says the items were moved and can be restored from the Recycle Bin.
